# Phase 1 (core only): camera stack must NOT be compiled.
# Merge this fragment LAST (after sm7150.config and sm7150-7.4-fixes.config)
# so it overrides the =m lines in arch/arm64/configs/sm7150.config
# (lines "Xiaomi Mi 9T" S5K3L6XX/OV8856 and the cam-r4 block at the end).
#
# Nothing in v7.4-rc2 (+ downstream) selects or depends on any of these
# symbols, so "is not set" sticks through olddefconfig.
# All WL2866D outputs (wl_avdd1/2, wl_dvdd1/2) feed camera sensors only
# in sm7150-xiaomi-sweet.dts, so dropping the regulator is safe.
#
# Deliberately NOT touched: MEDIA_SUPPORT, VIDEO_DEV, MEDIA_CONTROLLER,
# V4L2_FWNODE, VIDEO_CAMERA_SENSOR/VIDEO_CAMERA_LENS menus. Nothing selects
# MEDIA_SUPPORT or VIDEO_DEV (both are plain =m from the base config); they
# are still needed by VIDEO_QCOM_VENUS, VIDEO_QCOM_IRIS, USB_VIDEO_CLASS (UVC),
# RC/LIRC (IR_SPI, IR_GPIO_CIR) and CEC.

# Qualcomm camera subsystem + CCI I2C controller
# CONFIG_VIDEO_QCOM_CAMSS is not set
# CONFIG_I2C_QCOM_CCI is not set

# Camera power (downstream driver, sweet)
# CONFIG_REGULATOR_WL2866D is not set

# Camera sensors
# CONFIG_VIDEO_S5K3L6XX is not set
# CONFIG_VIDEO_OV8856 is not set
# CONFIG_VIDEO_OV5675 is not set
# CONFIG_VIDEO_IMX355 is not set
# CONFIG_VIDEO_IMX471 is not set
# CONFIG_VIDEO_GC02M1 is not set
# CONFIG_VIDEO_OV02B10 is not set
# CONFIG_VIDEO_S5KGW3 is not set

# Lens (VCM) driver
# CONFIG_VIDEO_DW9719 is not set

# Optional, stricter: also hide the whole sensor/lens menus by adding
#   "# CONFIG_VIDEO_CAMERA_SENSOR is not set" and
#   "# CONFIG_VIDEO_CAMERA_LENS is not set"
# as real lines. Not done for phase 1: they only gate the drivers above.
# (Careful: a line of exactly that form is NOT a comment to kconfig.)
